{"sha": "2004048c68d94a922690f0ec2aa819e07ffaf9d379b2e84c1c1425c92b36510f", "body": ["\\chapter{作为数的分数}\\label{ch:g5:fractions}", "", "分数不仅仅是一张饼的图画：它是一个真正的", "\\emph{数}，在数轴上有自己的位置 --- 有时", "恰好与某个小数位于同一位置。本章将连接这两个", "世界。（分数运算的完整法则见", "\\cref{ch:g6:fractions}及以后各章。）", "", "\\section{再论数轴上的分数}", "", "\\begin{example}[在数轴上定位与读数]\\label{ex:g5:fractions:place}", "在一条五等分的直线上，$\\frac{7}{5}$ 是 $7$ 步之外的点（每步一份，从 $0$ 起算），", "越过 $1$（即 $\\frac55$），位于 $1 + \\frac25$ 处。每个分数都在直线的某处；", "分母相同时，分子越大，", "位置越靠右。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[同一点，多个名字]\\label{prop:g5:fractions:equal}", "把每一份都二等分（或三等分\\,\\dots），", "点的位置并不会改变：", "\\[", "\\frac{1}{2} = \\frac{2}{4} = \\frac{3}{6} = \\frac{5}{10},", "\\qquad", "\\frac{2}{3} = \\frac{4}{6} = \\frac{20}{30}.", "\\]", "分子与分母同时乘（或除以）同一个数，", "所得分数是同一分数的另一种写法。", "\\end{proposition}", "\\admitted", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.62]", "  \\foreach \\i in {0,1} \\draw[omExo] (\\i*4,0) rectangle (\\i*4+4,1.0);", "  \\fill[omDef!40] (0.06,0.06) rectangle (3.94,0.94);", "  \\draw[thick] (0,0) rectangle (8,1.0);", "  \\node[right, font=\\small] at (8.3,0.5) {$\\frac12$};", "  \\begin{scope}[yshift=-1.7cm]", "  \\foreach \\i in {0,...,3} \\draw[omExo] (\\i*2,0) rectangle (\\i*2+2,1.0);", "  \\fill[omDef!40] (0.06,0.06) rectangle (1.94,0.94);", "  \\fill[omDef!40] (2.06,0.06) rectangle (3.94,0.94);", "  \\draw[thick] (0,0) rectangle (8,1.0);", "  \\node[right, font=\\small] at (8.3,0.5) {$\\frac24$};", "  \\end{scope}", "  \\begin{scope}[yshift=-3.4cm]", "  \\foreach \\i in {0,...,9} \\draw[omExo] (\\i*0.8,0) rectangle", "    (\\i*0.8+0.8,1.0);", "  \\foreach \\i in {0,...,4} \\fill[omDef!40] (\\i*0.8+0.05,0.06)", "    rectangle (\\i*0.8+0.75,0.94);", "  \\draw[thick] (0,0) rectangle (8,1.0);", "  \\node[right, font=\\small] at (8.3,0.5) {$\\frac{5}{10}$};", "  \\end{scope}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 三个长条，三种名字，同一个量：$\\frac12 = \\frac24 =", "\\frac{5}{10}$.}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{分数与小数}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[可以写成小数的分数]\\label{prop:g5:fractions:decimal}", "十分之几、百分之几、千分之几的分数\\emph{都是}", "小数：", "\\[", "\\frac{3}{10} = 0.3, \\qquad \\frac{27}{100} = 0.27 .", "\\]", "另有一些分数也有小数写法，只需化为", "十分之几或百分之几：", "\\[", "\\frac{1}{2} = \\frac{5}{10} = 0.5, \\qquad", "\\frac{1}{4} = \\frac{25}{100} = 0.25, \\qquad", "\\frac{3}{4} = 0.75, \\qquad", "\\frac{1}{5} = \\frac{2}{10} = 0.2 .", "\\]", "但并非所有分数都如此：$\\frac13 = 0.333\\dots$ 永远不会结束 --- ", "分数本身才是它唯一的精确写法。", "\\end{proposition}", "\\admitted", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=1.55]", "  \\draw[-Stealth] (-0.2,0) -- (7.6,0);", "  \\foreach \\i in {0,...,28} \\draw ({\\i*0.25},-0.05) -- ({\\i*0.25},0.05);", "  \\foreach \\i in {0,4,...,28} \\draw ({\\i*0.25},-0.09) -- ({\\i*0.25},0.09);", "  \\foreach \\x in {0,...,7} \\node[below, font=\\small] at (\\x,-0.1) {$\\x$};", "  \\fill[omDef] (0.5,0) circle (1.6pt)", "    node[above, font=\\small] {$\\frac12 = 0.5$};", "  \\fill[omThm] (2.75,0) circle (1.6pt)", "    node[above, font=\\small] {$\\frac{11}{4} = 2.75$};", "  \\fill[omMeth] (6.25,0) circle (1.6pt)", "    node[above, font=\\small] {$\\frac{25}{4} = 6.25$};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 一条数轴，两种写法：每个点都可以带一个分数名", "和一个小数名。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{example}[选择更方便的名字]\\label{ex:g5:fractions:choose}", "求 $12$ 的四分之三：用分数名更方便，", "$\\frac34$ 的 $12$ 是 $9$。比较 $\\frac34$ 与 $0.8$ 时，", "用小数名更方便，$0.75 < 0.8$。两种写法都会用，大有益处。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{比较分数的大小}", "", "\\begin{method}[三种比较方法]\\label{met:g5:fractions:compare}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item \\emph{分母相同}：份数多的更大，", "        $\\frac57 > \\frac37$；", "  \\item \\emph{分子相同}：\\emph{分母越小}的分数更大：", "        $\\frac35 > \\frac38$（五分之一", "        比八分之一大）；", "  \\item \\emph{参照点}：分别与 $\\frac12$ 或 $1$ 比较：", "        $\\frac38 < \\frac12 < \\frac59$，因此 $\\frac38 < \\frac59$。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{method}", ""]}